  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is something I noticed since the latest Security update : My portal world didn't worked anymore, not a single portal was loading, same issue with Blue Cat's portal world.\nI created a test world where the issue can be reproduced, the portal ID is set on Start(), the button (cube) can be used to change the portal ID, which also doesn't work : https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_9ecebe73-877e-4acb-9caf-8359b07fb283\nAfter further investigations with my friend Blue Cat, we noticed that :\n- If a VRCPortalMarker doesn't have a room ID set by default (so if the room ID field is empty), refreshing the portal with a new ID didn't worked.\n- Refreshing the portal only worked a short time after the player joined, so setting the portal ID on Start() or OnPlayerJoined() didn't worked, but it worked with SendCustomEventDelayedSecond(), I noticed that one second after OnPlayerJoined() was enough.",
